          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation from an airplane of a glowing phenomenon on the ground moving at the same speed as the airplane: very likely observation of moon reflections on water surfaces and flooded areas.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "30145fddd7a6f5b41733187658f9cf6bd30b2090a7b4ef8de5c34593790c96f9"
